VERDICT
================================================================================================
  The quoted 144.78 mOhm sits at the favourable edge of the distribution:
  1/6 seeds fall below it, 5/6 above.
  G2 as scored in the notebook (HIT at +0.30 %) is not representative;
  it scores HIT on 2/6 seeds.

  What DOES hold across every seed:
    - c1 is negative in 12/12 runs (the broken residual gave +0.023)
    - RMSE ~0.13 K at w=20 and ~0.07 K at w=200, against 0.62 K broken
    - the shape is recovered; only the AMPLITUDE is seed-sensitive
